-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §17 מורה בחטיבת ביניים: the full-position
-- week of a junior-high teacher — 36 hours, of which 23 frontal, 4
-- individual and 9 stay hours — what the stay hours are for, and a grade
-- coordinator's week.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `17 מורה בחטיבת ביניים`

-- akn:art_17 The opening: the week of a teacher in a 100% position under the reform, set out in (א)–(ה).

@ref akn:art_17__para_a akn:art_17__para_b akn:art_17__para_c akn:art_17__para_d
`a junior-high teacher's full week` MEANS `a week of` 23 4 9

#ASSERT `hours of the week` `a junior-high teacher's full week` EQUALS 36

-- (ג): a group of up to 5 pupils, or one pupil, 5 included, as in §15(ג).
GIVEN pupils IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a group for individual hours in a junior high school` pupils IF
    pupils AT LEAST 1 AND pupils AT MOST 5

-- (ד)(1): work meetings up to 4 weekly hours; (2): the rest on preparing,
-- meeting parents one by one and checking work and examinations.
@ref akn:art_17__para_d__subpara_1 akn:art_17__para_d__subpara_2 akn:art_17__para_d__subpara_2/p2 akn:art_17__para_d__subpara_2/p3 akn:art_17__para_d__subpara_2/p4
`work meetings a week at most, in a junior high school` MEANS 4

GIVEN `meeting hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the junior-high stay hours are lawfully divided` `meeting hours` IF
        `meeting hours` AT LEAST 0
    AND `meeting hours` AT MOST `work meetings a week at most, in a junior high school`

-- (ה): a grade coordinator's week by the classes in the grade, "עד 4"
-- holding 4 as in §15(ה); ¶2: the stay hours serve, among other things,
-- the coordinator's role.
@ref akn:art_17__para_e akn:art_17__para_e/t1 akn:art_17__para_e/p2
GIVEN classes IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `a junior-high grade coordinator's week` classes IS
    BRANCH IF classes AT MOST 4 THEN `a week of` 23 3 10
           IF classes AT MOST 6 THEN `a week of` 22 2 12
           IF classes AT MOST 8 THEN `a week of` 21 2 13
           OTHERWISE                 `a week of` 20 2 14

#ASSERT all (GIVEN c YIELD `hours of the week` (`a junior-high grade coordinator's week` c) EQUALS 36) (range 1 12)
-- The more classes in the grade, the fewer frontal hours, never more.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN c YIELD
                (`a junior-high grade coordinator's week` (c PLUS 1))'s `frontal hours`
                AT MOST (`a junior-high grade coordinator's week` c)'s `frontal hours`) (range 1 12)
#ASSERT `the junior-high stay hours are lawfully divided` 4
